Poco F1 wall clock from the PM8998 RTC: raw seconds plus an offset kept in the RTC alarm data registers (alarm
disabled); the platform expert publishes IORTC and serves get/setGMTTimeOfDay, so a boot no longer starts in 1970
(coreduetd spun ~75 % of a core re-ingesting Biome history after the 1970 -> 2026 jump).

